    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce are delighted to present to the market this rare and impressive 5 bedroom semi-detached home, complete with a separate, self-contained 1 bed apartment, ideally located in Lurgan Park, Renmore, Galway.\n\nPresented in immaculate condition throughout, No. 52 offers spacious and versatile accommodation, making it an ideal family home. \n\nThe property also provides excellent flexibility for those working from home, accommodating extended family or guests, or buyers seeking an additional source of rental income.\n\nOn entering the main residence, the welcoming hallway leads to a bright and comfortable living room positioned to the front of the property. This inviting space features timber flooring and a feature fireplace, creating a warm and homely atmosphere.\n\nTo the rear, the kitchen/dining room overlooks the private patio and garden and provides a practical space. \n\nThe house was recently upgraded with a brand new boiler for the central heating system. The boiler is housed externally along with a separate block built garden storage shed. There is ample parking for 2 cars on the driveway.\n\nUpstairs, the property boasts 5 well-proportioned bedrooms, with the master bedroom ensuite. A family bathroom and a separate shower room ensure excellent convenience for a busy household. \n\nA particularly attractive feature of this property is the separate self-contained 1 bed apartment, accessed independently via the front porch. \n\nThe apartment comprises a comfortable open-plan living room/kitchen/dining area, with the bedroom and shower room at the rear. This versatile extra accommodation has energy efficient electric heating and is ideal for guests, family members, a home office or potential rental income. \n\nRenmore is a mature and highly regarded residential area, offering excellent schools, recreational facilities, shops and public transport. Nearby primary schools include Scoil Chaitríona and Gaelscoil Dara, while Atlantic Technological University (ATU) is located on the Old Dublin Road. \n\n52 Lurgan Park is close to a range of healthcare facilities, including Bon Secours and Merlin Park hospitals and Galway Clinic. Business Parks and centres of employment at Ballybrit Mervue and Parkmore are only a short drive away. \n\nResidents can enjoy a strong selection of sporting and leisure amenities, including the Kingfisher Club, St. James' GAA and local community facilities, while Ballyloughane Beach and the surrounding green spaces provide excellent opportunities for walking and outdoor recreation. \n\nWith Galway city centre easily accessible and regular public transport services operating nearby, Lurgan Park offers an excellent balance of convenience, connectivity and quality of life.\n\nWhether seeking a substantial family home with extra accommodation or an investment opportunity with income potential, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
